  "title": "iQIYI Announces Change in Executive Leadership",
  "summary": "BEIJING, Jan. 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- iQIYI, Inc. (Nasdaq: IQ) (“iQIYI” or the “Company”), a leading provider of online entertainment video services in China, today announced that Mr. Jun Wang has resigned from his position as Chief Financial Officer, effective today, due to personal reasons.",
